platmon (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Ship the server as a static native binary, one package per architecture
    (amd64, arm64); the platmon client stays Python.
  * Check the started service's /api/status after install or upgrade and
    fail configuration when it does not become ready.
  * Include Debian copyright metadata, compressed changelogs and a CLI manual.
  * Use this changelog date for reproducible default build timestamps.
  * Include package file checksums and check package policy with Lintian.
  * Point the homepage and copyright source to github.com/platmon/platmon.

